==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|sg=[[reflexive]] [[pronoun]]}}

# A [[personal pronoun]], having a form of "[[self]]" as a [[suffix]] to show that the [[subject]]'s [[action]] [[affect]]s the subject [[itself]].
# In some languages, a pronoun that makes a transitive verb reflexive or reciprocal.
#:'''Spanish:''' Él '''[[se#Spanish|se]]''' [[lavarse#Spanish|lavó]] &mdash; ''He washed (himself).''
#:: Él [[lavar#Spanish|lavó]] &mdash; ''He washed (something).''
#:'''Russian:''' {{RUchar|[[он#Russian|Он]] [[мыться#Russian|помы́л'''ся''']]}} &mdash; ''He washed (himself).''
#::{{RUchar|[[он#Russian|Он]] [[мыть#Russian|помы́л]]}} &mdash; ''He washed (something).''

